<hr />
<p>This SCP was written in honor of the lovely <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6536693); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6536693); return false;">Placeholder McD</a></span> for the Holiday Gift-Swap. This gift was super fun to write, in part because Placeholder and I have near-identical taste in SCPs. In fact, though the main premise is brand new, I've been meaning to do a music SCP like this for quite some time, but never found the motivation. But, enough about me, here's to Placeholder MCD: An incredible author, and a lovely human being. Cheers!</p>
