<p>Boy, am I ever so lucky to be blessed with this gift. I asked for something complex and puzzle-y relating to music and one of my other interests. Henzoid went above and beyond, including elements of DoMC, AI, math, surrealism, esoteric classes, and actual composed snippets. I'm still figuring this one out, and it still totally blows me away. I'm excited to declass it soon; keep your eyes out for that.</p>
<p>Thank you to DarkStuff and Elogee for organizing the Art Exchange and for assigning me such a talented and like-minded gifter. Thank you Henzoid for being awesome. Thank you to pinch-hitters for making sure everyone enjoys the holiday season.</p>
<p>Merry Christmas, Happy Holidays, Wishful Winters, Super Solstice Season, etc.</p>

